# Work-AerobicToolkit

Open Source toolkit for creating professional Aerobic DJ Mixes.

The project is designed around one reusable engine that can power the CLI,
desktop app, web dashboard, AI agent, REST API, plugins, and mobile app.

## Quick start

```bash
python -m pip install -e ".[dev]"
python -m aerobictoolkit --version
pytest
```

See [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md) for the project boundaries
and [docs/roadmap.md](docs/roadmap.md) for the delivery plan.

## Features

- Music Scanner
- BPM Detection
- Energy Analysis
- Playlist Optimizer
- Harmonic Mixing
- Auto DJ Mix
- HTML Dashboard

## Requirements

Python 3.12+

